seanceguidearrives=The chalk smokes, and <name> steps out of it.
ghostguideunlock1=Breathe out. There. Now the mist knows you - Soul Exposure will not touch you again.
ghostguideintro=Coin? The dead have plenty and nothing to spend it on. I will take yours anyway - and buy whatever the mist gives you.
ghostguidenohire=The dead do not move in. Come back when you need something.
ghostguidetalk1=Everyone asks the same first question, and none of them like the answer.
ghostguidetalk2=Careful with the mist further out. It is not mine.
ghostguidetalk3=I was a surveyor. I still count things. It is restful.
ghostguidetalk4=Bring me a good dinner sometime. I cannot eat it. I would like to smell it.
wardengiveschalk=You have been out to the mist, then. Take this - chalk, ground from grave salt. Draw a circle at home and someone will answer.
seancenobodyanswers=The chalk here is old and cold.\nNothing answers it.

