[itemtooltip]
skystonehearttip=Trophy - the lit core a Skystone Golem walks on, and the only part of it that keeps its light once the rest is rubble. Magpie pays a premium.
bloomfangtip=Trophy - a tooth off the flower that bites. Eden grows nothing that does not want something. Magpie pays a premium.
mourningbandtip=Trophy - the black trim off a Stone Mourner's carved suit, and the only cloth in the whole statue. Magpie pays a premium.
soulcollartip=Trophy - what the Mourning Bride still wears at the throat. Cold to hold, and it hums. Magpie pays a premium.
stripedhorntip=Trophy - taken out of a Door Mimic. Whatever it last ate had one of these. Magpie pays a premium.
