swhcrookedarrivalreward=4x Reality Shard

[misc]
swhladderpostask=The toll-house on the sky road. My book is in the cabinet - every parcel that never arrived. Get it before the Tollwright eats it.
swhladderpostdone=There it is. Every page a promise I mean to keep. Take the satchel - it has seen more than you have.
swhladderposttarget=Skyway Toll-House (Magpie's ledger)
swhladderroundask=Sixteen cloudberries, eight wind wheat, four aurora petals. Then I set what this sky has not drunk in forty years.
swhladderrounddone=Smell that. That is storm, in bottles. Three for you, the rest is on my shelf from now on.
swhladderroundtarget=Driftlands and Aurora Shoals (Grange Cellar)
swhladderprototypeask=The test range in the Stormveil. Bring me storm glass, shards and fulgurite - I want to read what Prototype Nine is before it shows me.
swhladderprototypedone=Aha. That is not a machine, it is a sentence nobody finished. Take the lens - it reads stone.
swhladderprototypetarget=Stormveil Test Range
swhedenreachask=Further out, past the Driftlands, the Garden begins. Go there. Stand in it. Then tell me how it smells.
swhedenreachdone=Of honey and quarrels? Then it is the one. Here - seed from it. Sow it where you live.
swhedenreachtarget=Garden of Eden (from about 600 tiles out)
swhedenplantstarget=Garden of Eden (Eden chests, Hedge Labyrinth)
swhladderciderask=Paradise apples, four. Two coconuts. Four Eden sap - from the flowers that bite back. I want to know whether paradise ferments.
swhladderciderdone=It ferments. Of course it ferments. Take three - and tell nobody how strong it is.
swhladdercidertarget=Garden of Eden (Hedge Labyrinth, Bloom Maws)
swhladdercontrabandask=Six scales, four venom fangs, and the Writ from the display case in the toll-house. With that paper no road asks me what I carry.
swhladdercontrabanddone=Countersigned twice. From today my voyages arrive more often - for everyone here.
swhladdercontrabandtarget=Garden of Eden (serpents) and the Skyway Toll-House
swhsteinfeldvigiltarget=Steinfeld (Grave Heath)
swhladderechoask=Echo shards, ten. And a mourning band - the Stone Mourners wear them, and they do not give them up gladly.
swhladderechodone=Listen... someone is counting. I have written it down. Take the conch, it listens for you.
swhladderechotarget=Steinfeld (Stone Mourners)
swhladderstepsask=Eleven grave salt, eleven spirit moss, eleven pale stone. One for every step. Then he may stand still.
swhladderstepsdone=He stood still. For the first time. Take my lantern - it shows you who is still walking.
swhladderstepstarget=Steinfeld (Slab Fields, Grave Heath)
swhmortimerritestarget=Ghost Realm (soul thread, bonewood)
swhcaspernforgetarget=Ghost Realm (spectral ore, the Gloomfen)
swheleanortarget=Eleanor in the Spire Village
swhladdermemoryask=A soul collar. The brides in the Aftergarden still wear them. And ten bonewood, eight ectoplasm. Then I show you what memory weighs.
swhladdermemorydone=Hear how it rings? That is somebody's wedding. Carry it well.
swhladdermemorytarget=Ghost Realm (Mourning Brides, Wedding Feast)
swhladdershroudsask=That feast out there has gone on too long. Ten soul thread, six veil essence - then I cover them.
swhladdershroudsdone=Covered properly, all of them. Take the brooch. You wear it for the ones you will not forget.
swhladdershroudstarget=Ghost Realm (Wedding Feast, Gloom Shades)
swhcrookedarrivalask=Far out, where the world starts to bend: a yard full of doors. Go there. Come back. Tell me whether they looked at you.
swhcrookedarrivaldone=They looked at you? Good. Then they know you now. Here - shards from there.
swhcrookedarrivaltarget=Crooked Beyond (the Door Yard)
swhcrookeddoortarget=Crooked Beyond (warp resin, strange fabric)
swhladderseedsask=Eye seeds, six, from the bend. And three knowledge cuttings. I want to know at last what my three seeds are.
swhladderseedsdone=They are... crowns. Of roots. One of them is yours.
swhladderseedstarget=Crooked Beyond (Tongue Plants)
swhladdershellsask=Eight striped shells, off the beetles. And a horn from a door that wanted to eat you. A door has to be taught manners.
swhladdershellsdone=It knocks now before it opens. Here - the keys. To everything that still closes.
swhladdershellstarget=Crooked Beyond (Stripe Beetles, Door Mimics)
swhladderformask=Form 666-B. Application to inspect Hell's books. Enclosed: sixteen shards, twenty-four oddwood, thirty charwood. In triplicate.
swhladderformdone=Approved. Approved! They sent me a copy - and you their seal. Do not read what it says.
swhladderformtarget=Hell (Hell's Hem, the Furnace Reach)
swhladderwaitmagpie=No freight for you until <chapter> is open. Help the others in the village first.
swhladderwaithalda=The cellar is still working. Come back when <chapter> is open for you.
swhladderwaitossian=I am still reading. When <chapter> is open for you, I have questions only you can answer.
swhladderwaiteveleen=Not yet. When <chapter> is open for you, I will send you into my garden.
swhladderwaitives=The Quiet Reach is waiting. Come when <chapter> is open for you.
swhladderwaitmortimer=Too early for my kind of work. Come back when <chapter> is open.
swhladderwaitcaspern=My fire can wait. Come when <chapter> is open for you.
swhladderwaiteleanor=I do not know yet what I want. Ask me again when <chapter> is open for you.
swhladderwaitknott=No door leads you to me yet. Come when <chapter> is open for you.
swhladderchapter1=Chapter I - the Skyreach
swhladderchapter2=Chapter II - the Garden of Eden
swhladderchapter3=Chapter III - Steinfeld
swhladderchapter4=Chapter IV - the Ghost Realm
swhladderchapter5=Chapter V - the Crooked Beyond
swhladderchapter6=Chapter VI - Hell
swhsignvillage=NOTICE BOARD - SPIRE VILLAGE
The people here need help, one thing at a time.
Start with Magpie, Halda and Ossian.
Whoever wants to go further out, asks again when back.

