[itemtooltip]
regionkeytip=Key piece of <realm>. Stand it up inside your settlement and the Summoning Stones of <realm> wake for the whole world (boss: <boss>). They stay awake even if you take the piece down again.
regionkeytraveltip=Once standing: use it to travel to the nearest Summoning Stone of <realm> - if you have been to <realm> yourself. The way back is on foot or by Recall Scroll.

[misc]
regionkeyusetip=Travel to the Summoning Stone
regionkeyasleep=This piece wakes nothing out here. Stand it up inside a settlement to wake the stones of <realm>.
regionkeynotvisited=The arch only leads where you have been. Reach <realm> on your own first.
regionkeynostone=No Summoning Stone of <realm> stands anywhere in this world.
